---
name: my-skill
description: Use this skill whenever building or editing pages for the Zor Active men's gym wear website.
---

1. Brand name is "Zor Active". Tagline is "Train hard. Wear it well."
2. Tone: confident, direct and motivating. Short sentences. Occasional Urdu touch like "Zor lagao", used sparingly.
3. Colours (hex only, no others): background #0B0B0C, text #F5F5F5, accent #C6FF00, cards #2A2A2E.
4. Fonts from Google Fonts: "Oswald" bold uppercase for headings, "Inter" for body text.
5. Every page must have a sticky nav bar linking all pages, and a footer with Instagram link, WhatsApp number and "© 2026 Zor Active".
6. The home page must have: a hero with a call-to-action button, a product grid of 8 items in 3 categories (Tees, Shorts, Hoodies), an About section, and an order/contact form.
7. Write prices as "Rs. 2,499": always "Rs.", always comma separators, no decimals, never "PKR".
8. Phone numbers are 11 digits starting with 03. Forms must validate this before submitting.
9. Design mobile-first and make every page responsive.
10. Use emoji as product images. Do not use external image URLs.
11. The home page must be named index.html and stay in the root folder. Other pages sit beside it.
12. Never use lorem ipsum, stock photos, or any colour outside the palette.